{"version":1,"content":"<p>三星電子今日宣佈對公司高管團隊進行調整，其中最受關注的變化是盧泰文結束其擔任的移動體驗業務部門負責人職務。這意味着，在執掌三星移動業務近七年之後，盧泰文將卸下該部門領導職責，由崔元俊接任。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587242.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:04:02.786803+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:41:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:14.389349+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:14.389349+00:00","content_hash":"499ccdc8a16fcbf055875bcc2097c09656ed1f7515d0f21229dcfc330945b6a3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}